     token reaches, so it glared as a bright blob over the dark card and its own
     start-time read grey-on-white. Repaint the pill to a dark overlay and lift the
     time to a light label; the child LIVE badge keeps its red. A LIVE-now card's
     .state is sized exactly to that red badge (no exposed background), so the same
     rule is invisible there — no need for a relational selector the .org.css
     sanitizer would strip. */
  .preview [class*="state___"] { background-color: rgba(20, 24, 29, 0.85) !important; }
