  /* A public mylist header's description carries the same shape: the broad
     `[class*="-description"]` pass colours the .MylistHeader-description container,
     but its inner text is a plain div the site hardcodes #252525, so the whole
     blurb read dark-on-dark on the #1c2128 card. Lift the inner div (only the
